{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X的音乐感受描写不如Y细密，尤其缺少随乐句变化逐步出现的具体感官提示，重点词也没有Y的高亮那么醒目。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X虽然叙事句偏长，但左右分区稳定，观众可以先扫左侧抓住故事，再用右侧感受补充音乐体验；而且人物为什么放松、退缩、害怕失去、最终不再隐藏心意，交代得更充分，14段的心理变化也衔接得更自然。Y的关键词高亮和按小节出现的感受很有优势，音乐体验更细腻，但感受提示数量较多，部分表达重复，纵向交替也容易让注意力在故事和感受之间频繁切换。整体而言，我更愿意选X，因为听众最终需要的不只是感受到音乐，还要看懂这个人的心为什么一步步走到这里。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "83875783-f92d-4e2a-b953-dc551ad25d81", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T090744459512Z", "elapsed_seconds": 100.438, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T09:09:24.895358+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e2639c6421622c161011f26b7b2dc26299537e32ed798abf943c74f4dccd013a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308c